orbitra-bluespace-preview-hint = Each cycle produces one batch from the selected category. Numbers count items or individual units of material.
orbitra-bluespace-preview-chance = Batch chance: { $chance }%
orbitra-bluespace-preview-product = { $count } × { $name }
orbitra-bluespace-help = Connection and safety
orbitra-bluespace-instructions-harvester = Connect the anchored harvester to a high-voltage cable. Normal mode requests 250 kW; overdrive requests 500 kW. Each batch requires 15 MJ of received energy: about 60 or 30 s at full power. Keep a clear output tile 2–3 tiles away. Overdrive raises the background faster; at high levels local incursions may occur. A critical background shuts down the machine.
orbitra-bluespace-instructions-prober = Connect this device to the APC network and a powered research server on the same station. It consumes 25 kW and raises the background while generating research. Multiple probers have diminishing returns. A critical background shuts down research probers.
orbitra-bluespace-instructions-suppressor = Connect this device to the APC network. It consumes 50 kW while lowering the station's background and remains available during an emergency shutdown.
orbitra-bluespace-warning-source = Bluespace monitoring
orbitra-bluespace-warning = Bluespace background has reached { $level }. Reduce production or activate suppressors.
orbitra-bluespace-danger = Dangerous bluespace background: { $level }. Local instability and harvester incursions are possible.
orbitra-bluespace-critical = Critical bluespace background: { $level }. Research probers and harvesters are shutting down. Use suppressors and reduce the background below 80 before restarting.
